{
  "note": "The Authentication users table's filter (crates/console-front/src/auth/filter.rs USER_FIELDS, console/src/auth/fields.ts). The engine and the browser parse and validate every text against these fields and must give exactly this result or this error, UTF-16 span included. What each case means to the index is pinned in user-filter.json.",
